### Call the issue_close tool with reason not-planned and a comment; expects outcome "closed" (or "already-closed"), reason "not_planned" and the issue URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 32,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "issue_close",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "issue": 1,
      "reason": "not-planned",
      "comment": "Closing as not planned."
    }
  }
}

### Call the issue_close tool with issue 0; expects a tool error naming the "issue" parameter
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

