}

### Call the issue_reopen tool with a comment; posts the comment, reopens the issue and expects the outcome "open" (or "already-open" with no comment posted) and the issue URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 73,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "issue_reopen",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "issue": 1,
      "comment": "Reopening: the fix did not cover every case."
    }
  }
}

### Call the issue_reopen tool with an invalid issue number; expects a tool error naming the "issue" parameter
