  }
}

### Call the pr_close tool with a comment; posts the comment, closes the pull request without merging or deleting its branch and expects the outcome "closed" (or "already-closed" with no comment posted) and the pull request URL; a merged pull request is refused
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 75,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "pr_close",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "pr": 1,
      "comment": "Closing: superseded by another pull request."
    }
  }
}

### Call the pr_close tool with an invalid pull request number; expects a tool error naming the "pr" parameter
